  "What belief sets a Muslim apart, per as-Sa'di on 2:3?": ["As-Sa'di 2:3: 'fa-hadha-l-iman alladhi yumayyizu bihi-l-muslimu mina-l-kafir.' Which iman?", "Belief in stars", "Belief in what we see", "Belief in luck"],
