  "Why is prayer light for the humble, per as-Sa'di on 2:45?": ["As-Sa'di 2:46: 'alladhina yazunnuna annahum mulaqu rabbihim.' Why is it light for them?", "They pray alone", "They pray quickly", "They skip parts"],
