  "Who will be with the prophets, in An-Nisa?": ["Quran 4:69: 'wa man yuti'i-llaha wa-r-rasula fa-ula'ika ma'a-lladhina an'ama-llahu 'alayhim.' Who?", "The famous", "The strong", "The rich"],
