  "To which prophet was the Tawrah sent down?": ["Ibn Kathir 5:44: the Tawrah came down to which 'abd and rasul?", "Isa", "Dawud", "Ibrahim"],
  "Who was entrusted to protect Allah's Book, in 5:44?": ["Quran 5:44: 'wa-r-rabbaniyyuna wal-ahbaru bima-stuhfizu.' Who were entrusted?", "Kings only", "Merchants", "Poets"],
  "What does 5:45 call forgiving the one who harmed you?": ["Quran 5:45: 'fa-man tasaddaqa bihi fahuwa kaffaratun lah.' What is pardoning called?", "Useless", "A weakness", "Forbidden"],
  "Who explained this, as Ibn Kathir quotes?": ["Ibn Kathir 5:45: kaffarah for the aggressor, ajr for the victim. Which Companion said so?", "Fir'awn", "Qarun", "Abu Jahl"],
  "Is the victim forced to pardon, in 5:45?": "Quran 5:45: 'fa-man tasaddaqa bih' obliges the victim to pardon.",
