  "Where do all people return, in 5:48?": ["Quran 5:48: 'ila-llahi marji'ukum jami'a.' Where is the return?", "To the earth only", "To nothing", "To their tribes"],
  "Who is best in judgment, in 5:50?": ["Quran 5:50: 'wa man ahsanu mina-llahi hukma.' Who is best in hukm?", "The majority", "The elders", "The richest"],
  "What judgment does 5:50 blame people for seeking?": ["Quran 5:50: 'a-fa-hukma-l-jahiliyyati yabghun.' What are they blamed for seeking?", "That of justice", "That of the prophets", "That of the Quran"],
  "For whom is this clear, in 5:50?": ["Quran 5:50: 'li-qawmin yuqinun.' For whom?", "The proud", "The sleepy", "The careless"],
  "How are this people with the believers, in 5:54?": ["Quran 5:54: 'adhillatin 'ala-l-mu'minin.' How are they with believers?", "Proud", "Harsh", "Distant"],
  "What do they not fear, in 5:54?": ["Quran 5:54: 'wa la yakhafuna lawmata la'im.' What do they not fear?", "The Last Day", "Sin", "Allah"],
  "Allah loves them and they love Him, in 5:54.": "Quran 5:54: 'yuhibbuhum wa yuhibbunah.'",
  "What does Allah do for a servant He loves, per as-Sa'di on 5:54?": ["As-Sa'di 5:54: 'qabila minhu-l-yasir ... wa ghafara lahu-l-kathir.' What does Allah do?", "Gives no tests", "Makes him famous", "Makes him rich"],
  "What must come with loving Allah, per as-Sa'di on 5:54?": ["As-Sa'di 5:54: what is the sign that must go with mahabbah of Allah?", "Silence", "Leaving people", "Wearing wool"],
  "Love of Allah without knowing Him is very lacking.": "As-Sa'di 5:54: mahabbah of Allah without ma'rifah of Him falls far short.",
