  "Which believers does 5:55 describe?": ["Quran 5:55: 'yuqimuna-s-salata wa yu'tuna-z-zakata wa hum raki'un.' Which believers?", "Those who shout", "Those who boast", "Those who sleep in"],
  "Who wins in the end, in 5:56?": ["Quran 5:56: 'fa-inna hizba-llahi humu-l-ghalibun.' Who wins?", "The largest army", "The richest group", "No one"],
  "What did some people mock, in 5:58?": ["Quran 5:58: 'idha nadaytum ila-s-salati-ttakhadhuha huzuwan.' What did they mock?", "The market", "The rain", "Poetry"],
