  "Did the Prophet ﷺ hide any part of the revelation, per Aishah?": "Bukhari 4612: Aishah's 'fa-qad kadhab' backs one who says Muhammad ﷺ hid part of the wahy.",
  "Who would protect him, in 5:67?": ["Quran 5:67: 'wallahu ya'simuka mina-n-nas.' Who protects him?", "A wall", "His tribe", "Rome"],
