  "Whom does Allah send over us, in 6:61?": ["Quran 6:61: 'wa yursilu 'alaykum hafazah.' Whom does He send?", "Jinn", "Kings", "Birds"],
  "What does Al-Qahir mean, per Ibn Kathir?": ["Ibn Kathir 6:61: 'wa huwa-l-qahiru fawqa 'ibadih.' What is al-Qahir?", "The One who sleeps", "The One who forgets", "A king of Persia"],
  "The angels who take souls sometimes fail in their duty.": "Quran 6:61: 'wa hum la yufarritun' allows the angels of death to fall short.",
