  "When 6:65 named a torment from above, what did he ﷺ say?": ["Bukhari 4628: at 'min fawqikum', what were his words?", "All praise is for Allah", "Allah is the Greatest", "Glory be to Allah"],
  "6:65 names a torment from above, and from where else?": ["Quran 6:65: 'min fawqikum aw min tahti arjulikum.' Where else?", "From the right", "From the left", "From behind"],
  "He ﷺ sought refuge again when from below your feet came down.": "Bukhari 4628: at 'aw min tahti arjulikum', he ﷺ said ''a'udhu bi-wajhik' again.",
