  "With what should we remind, in 6:70?": ["Quran 6:70: 'wa dhakkir bih.' With what?", "Gossip", "Jokes", "Poetry"],
  "On that Day a big ransom can buy freedom.": "Ibn Kathir 6:70: 'wa in ta'dil kulla 'adl' means some fidyah will be taken that Day.",
  "In the parable of 6:71, who calls the lost man?": ["Quran 6:71: 'lahu ashabun yad'unahu ila-l-huda.' Who calls him?", "Nobody", "A king", "The idols"],
