  "What did Ibrahim say when the star set, in 6:76?": ["Quran 6:76: 'fa-lamma afala qal ...' What were his words?", "Bring it back", "I will follow it", "It is the greatest"],
  "In what order did Ibrahim point, in 6:76-78?": ["Quran 6:76-78: Ibrahim said 'hadha rabbi' three times. In what order?", "Sun, moon, star", "Moon, sun, star", "Sun, star, moon"],
  "Per Ibn Kathir, Ibrahim was really unsure who his Lord was.": "Ibn Kathir 6:76: Ibrahim's 'hadha rabbi' came from real doubt, not from debating his people.",
